{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/953934-wizard-car-wars","id":953934,"title":"Wizard Car Wars","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-19T11:47:23-07:00","id":953934,"title":"Wizard Car Wars","content":"So. Cars are really dangerous things to be in during a conflict between mages, right? All the velocity and metal and capacity for chaos and so forth. How do you think mages cope with that?<br /> <br /> Do they just avoid ever using a car during a conflict (or ever, if they're paranoid)? Is there some decent way to hang magical defenses on a car? Is it a push towards mass transit if your enemies would avoid the sleepers around you?<br /> <br /> For the sufficiently isolated from humanity it might be possible to forgo fast travel that isn't Space, but this seems like an area of interesting compromises.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1134-nicias","name":"Nicias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"274"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-19T12:16:49-07:00","id":953947,"title":"","content":"Imbued Item: Car.<br /> Let the awesome commence.<br /> Perfected materials, optional.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-19T12:26:35-07:00","id":953952,"title":"","content":"Wonderful Machine. This fancy convertible is also a battle tank.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","name":"Justin Sane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-19T18:43:46-07:00","id":954141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Justin Sane</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/953934-wizard-car-wars?p=953952#post953952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wonderful Machine. This fancy convertible is also a battle tank.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/o2Z1yLO9C-Q\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/o2Z1yLO9C-Q\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/o2Z1yLO9C-Q\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/o2Z1yLO9C-Q </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T01:36:42-07:00","id":954885,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/564x/74/64/7d/74647da8392242031e96205b92917767.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11641-yelesom","name":"Yelesom","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11641_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T10:25:27-07:00","id":955673,"title":"","content":"Cars are super-dangerous to <i>normal</i> people. For a Mage, walking down the sidewalk is dangerous.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T13:41:08-07:00","id":955856,"title":"","content":"It's probably something they wouldn't think about until an attack happened to them or someone they knew, at which point they might dive into paranoia or simply be reasonably cautious.<br /> <br /> My werewolf's used the prey's cars against them or their buddies in about half our sacred hunts so far, but not everyone has teleportation, so it's not like you're going to walk everywhere. Even if you did that just means <i>other </i>cars can become weapons.<br /> <br /> Just like real people, mages are likely to appreciate that there's dangers in the world they can try to prepare for or diminish the chances of causing harm, but in the end they're just something you have to live with if you want to live a 'normal' life. Or they go on some life-long mission to destroy <a href=\"http://www.eldritchdark.com/writings/short-stories/88/the-great-god-awto\" target=\"_blank\">the great got Awto</a> and cripple humanity's transportation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 08-22-2016, 04:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T17:46:27-07:00","id":956023,"title":"","content":"Mages compensate for combat (Or any other situation) in cars with magic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T14:04:13-07:00","id":960009,"title":"","content":"Anything Matter can do to cars, it can also do to air surrounding you or/and your clothes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T22:16:07-07:00","id":960239,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/953934-wizard-car-wars?p=960009#post960009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anything Matter can do to cars, it can also do to air surrounding you or/and your clothes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Looking forward to someone using wonderous machine on their shoes to give themselves wheels.<br /> Nezha would be proud.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11641-yelesom","name":"Yelesom","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11641_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-30T01:19:42-07:00","id":960291,"title":"","content":"Wonderful Machine. This convertible / battle tank is also a fancy suit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","name":"Justin Sane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-08T11:47:01-07:00","id":965774,"title":"","content":"<b>The Clown Car</b> - This brightly colored VW Bug has been Enhanced with Space to be <i>far</i> more spacious on the inside. Despite looking like it might be able to fit <i>maybe</i> four people, it is the perfect getaway vehicle for a Cabal or two.<br /> <br /> <b>The Mystery Machine</b> - The old 60s conversion van is a mobile Demense and Sanctum, enhanced with its owner's Soul Stone, and complete with an array of occult and ritual tools and supplies for traveling investigators. Last known possessors were reputed to be a Cabal of Guardians of the Veil.<br /> <br /> <b>Death On Wheels</b> - The pride and joy of a slightly crazed Moros car mechanic, this Cadillac serves as the Anchor for an artificially strengthened Ghost bound to it (who often uses its Strengthen Influence to improve performance, Manipulate Influence to &quot;autopilot&quot;, and Image Manifestation to communicate via the rear-view mirror and/or radio). Many of its parts have been replaced with Perfected materials, and not a few werewolves have met their end beneath its Lunargent grill.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 09-08-2016, 02:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}